cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
title: "OC Enricher Support"
abstract: "A command-line tool that reads an OpenCitations Meta CSV dump, builds Bibliographic Resources compliant with the OpenCitations Data Model, enriches them with external identifiers via oc_graphenricher, and saves the result to disk."
